From: SonoPlan <sonoplan@local>
Subject: [PATCH] spps: deposit punctual energy on start tetra (UTILISER)

Upstream UTILISER FreeParticleTranslation navigates to the end tetra first,
then deposits only if that tetra has linkedRecepteurP. Particles leaving the
receiver-linked tetra in one timestep never deposit (CI: walls absorb, .recp
energy stays 0). Deposit on the start tetra before navigation.

Pinned: 929a5c8e5f590b189f29155faeff8670f3699479
---
--- a/src/spps/CalculationCore.cpp
+++ b/src/spps/CalculationCore.cpp
@@ -1,5 +1,12 @@
 void CalculationCore::FreeParticleTranslation(CONF_PARTICULE &configurationP,const vec3 &translationVector)
 {
+	// SonoPlan: deposit on start-tetra linked receivers before navigating away.
+	// Upstream UTILISER path only deposited on the *end* tetra; particles that
+	// leave a linked tetra in one timestep wrote zero punctual energy while
+	// still hitting walls (minimal_room CI).
+	if(configurationP.currentTetra && configurationP.currentTetra->linkedRecepteurP)
+		reportTool->ParticuleFreeTranslation(configurationP,configurationP.position+translationVector);
+
 	if(configurationP.currentTetra)
 	{
 		bool changeTetrahedra=true;
@@ -21,8 +28,6 @@
 			}
 		}
 	}
-	if(configurationP.currentTetra->linkedRecepteurP)
-		reportTool->ParticuleFreeTranslation(configurationP,configurationP.position+translationVector);
 
 	//////////////
 	// Translation de la particule
